  "text": "This solution, Cyclone Preparedness Programme (CPP) Modernization addresses natural catastrophe through public private partnerships in Bangladesh between Government of Bangladesh, Bangladesh Meteorological Department, Bangladesh Red Crescent Society (BDRCS), International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies (IFRC), and American Red Cross. The program was implemented in 1972 and focuses on collaboration, raising awareness, and accessibility.",
